#34600
veiled fountain black stone violet water~
the Veiled Fountain~
The Veiled Fountain murmurs quietly against a wall of black stone.~
Black stone curls around a basin of clear water. Violet light moves
beneath the surface in slow threads, turning the fountain into a calm
landmark rather than an object of worship.
~
