a crimson-marble bust of Kokudar~
A crimson-marble bust of Kokudar watches over the gallery.~
The bust is deliberately restrained: Kokudar in travel-worn armor,
carved from deep red marble veined with pale silver. A small plaque
records only his name and the founding of this incarnation of the
citadel.
~
